    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by the Hon. Harshana Rajakaruna, M. P. for Gampaha District on 06th of September, 2023\n\n(Published in the Gazette on August 29, 2023)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPrice : Rs. 18.00Postage : Rs. 150.00\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n[Bill No. 202]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nBILL\n\nA\n\nHESHA FRIENDSHIP FOUNDATION (INCORPORATION)\n\nto incorporate the Hesha Friendship Foundation\n\n1Hesha Friendship Foundation (Incorporation)\n\nPreamble\n\nShort title\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE HESHA FRIENDSHIP FOUNDATION\n\nWHEREAS an Association called and known as the\u201cHesha Friendship Foundation\u201d has heretofore been formedin Sri Lanka for the purpose of effectually carrying out andtransacting all objects and matters connected with the saidFoundation according to the rules agreed to by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was formed and has applied to beincorporated and it will be for the public advantage to grantsuch application:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Hesha FriendshipFoundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2023."
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_bills",
    "doc_id": "2023-09-06-2023-09-06-380-2023-en",
    "num": "2023-09-06-380-2023-en",
    "date_str": "2023-09-06",
    "description": "Hesha Friendship Foundation (Incorporation) - Bill",
    "url_metadata": "https://documents.gov.lk/view/bills/bl_2023.html",
    "lang": "en",
    "url_pdf": "https://documents.gov.lk/view/bills/2023/9/380-2023_E.pdf",
    "doc_number": "380/2023",
    "chunk_id": "2023-09-06-2023-09-06-380-2023-en-0001",
    "chunk_index": 1,
    "language": "en",
    "md5": "18d0dcef548a7315a02632c114f348ab",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1708,
    "chunk_text": "AND WHEREAS the said Foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was formed and has applied to beincorporated and it will be for the public advantage to grantsuch application:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Hesha FriendshipFoundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2023.\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\n(a)to provide provision to protect, maintain disciplineand cultural ethics;\n\n(b)to extend support to services rendered by seniorcitizens organizations and to encourage suchorganization:\n\nIncorporationof theHeshaFriendshipFoundation\n\n30\n\n2Hesha Friendship Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n(c)to implement social mobilization programs andeducational and training programs for thedevelopment of the children and women;\n\n(d)to liaise and co-ordinate with other local or foreigninstitutions which have similar objects.\n\n4.(1) The management of the affairs of the Corporationshall, subject to the rules corporation, be administered byCommittee of Management consisting of not more thaneleven office bearers inclusive of the Chairman, Secretary,Treasurer and such number of members as may be providedor in rules and elected in accordance therewith.\n\n(2) The first Committee of Management shall consist ofthe members of the Committee of Management holding officeon the day immediately preceding the date of commencementof this Act and shall continue to hold office until a newCommittee of Management is elected in accordance withthe rules in section 6 of this Act."
  },
