    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPrice : Rs. 84.00Postage : Rs. 150.00\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nBILL\n\nA\n\nPresented by the Minister of Public Security on 03rd of October, 2023\n\n(Published in the Gazette on September 18, 2023)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 207]\n\nONLINE SAFETY\n\nto establish the Online Safety Commission; to make provisions to prohibitonline communication of certain statements of fact in Sri Lanka; to preventthe use of online accounts and inauthentic online accounts for prohibitedpurposes; to make provisions to identify and declare online locations usedfor prohibited purposes in Sri Lanka; to suppress the financing and othersupport of communication of false statements of fact and for mattersconnected therewith or incidental thereto\n\n1Online Safety\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\nL.D.-O 34/2021\n\nAN ACT TO ESTABLISH THE ONLINE SAFETY COMMISSION; TO MAKE\n\nPROVISIONS TO PROHIBIT ONLINE COMMUNICATION OF CERTAIN\n\nSTATEMENTS OF FACT IN SRI LANKA; TO PREVENT THE USE OF ONLINE\n\nACCOUNTS AND INAUTHENTIC ONLINE ACCOUNTS FOR PROHIBITED\n\nPURPOSES; TO MAKE PROVISIONS TO IDENTIFY AND DECLARE ONLINE\n\nLOCATIONS USED FOR PROHIBITED PURPOSES IN SRI LANKA; TO\n\nSUPPRESS THE FINANCING AND OTHER SUPPORT OF COMMUNICATION\n\nOF FALSE STATEMENTS OF FACT AND FOR MATTERS CONNECTED\n\nTHEREWITH OR INCIDENTAL THERETO.\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows: -\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Online Safety Act,No. of 2023.\n\n2. The provisions of this Act shall apply where \u2013\n\n(a)a person commits an offence under this Act inrespect of a citizen of Sri Lanka, while being presentin Sri Lanka or outside Sri Lanka;"
