    "chunk_text": "3\n\nTHE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of October 06, 2023\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 12.10.2023)\n\nANTI-CORRUPTION (AMENDMENT )\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nTo Amend The Anti-Corruption Act, No. 9 Of 2023\n\nOrdered to be published by the Minister of justice,Prison Affairs and Constitutional Reforms\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00 Postage : Rs. 25.00\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n4\n\nStatement of Legal Effect\n\nClause 2:This Clause amends sections 4, 7, 8, 10,17, 21, 23 and 80 of the Anti-CorruptionAct, No. 9 of 2023 and the legal effect ofthe amendment is to rectify certainincorrect terms appearing in the Sinhalatext of that Act.\n\n1\n\n5\n\n10\n\nL.D.O. 65/2023\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE ANTI-CORRUPTIONACT, NO. 9 OF 2023\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows: -\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Anti-Corruption(Amendment) Act, No. .\u2026\u2026 of 2023.\n\n2. The sections of the Anti-Corruption Act, No. 9 of 2023specified in Column I of the Schedule hereto are herebyamended by the substitution for the words specified in thecorresponding entry in Column II, of the words specified inthe corresponding entry in Colum III of that Schedule.\n\n3. In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nShort title\n\nAmendmentof certainsections ofthe Act,No. 9 of2023specified inthe Schedule\n\nSinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency\n\n2\n\nDEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\n[Section 2]\n\nColumn I Column II Column III\n\nSections Amended Repeal Insert\n\n4 (1)Constitutional CouncilConstitutional Council\n\n4 (2)(g)Constitutional CouncilConstitutional Council\n\n4 (3)Constitutional CouncilConstitutional Council\n\n7 (2)Constitutio