    "chunk_text": "11The Recognition and Enforcement of International SettlementAgreements Resulting from MediationTHE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of October 13, 2023\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 16.10.2023)\n\nTHE RECOGNITION AND ENFORCEMENT OF INTERNATIONAL\n\nSETTLEMENT AGREEMENTS RESULTING FROM\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nAN ACT to give effect to the United Nations Convention on InternationalSettlement Agreements resulting from Mediation known as the SingaporeConvention on Mediation; to make Provisions for the Recognition andEnforcement of International Settlement Agreements; and to provide formatters connected therewith or incidental thereto.Ordered to be published by the Minister of justice,Prison Affairs and Constitutional Reforms\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 20.00 Postage : Rs. 50.00\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n12The Recognition and Enforcement of International Settlement AgreementsResulting from Mediation\n\n1The Recognition and Enforcement of International SettlementAgreements Resulting from Mediation\n\nL.D.-O 42/2022\n\nAN ACT TO GIVE EFFECT TO THE UNITED NATIONS CONVENTION\n\nON INTERNATIONAL SETTLEMENT AGREEMENTS RESULTING FROMMEDIATION KNOWN AS THE SINGAPORE CONVENTION ONMEDIATION; TO MAKE PROVISIONS FOR THE RECOGNITION ANDENFORCEMENT OF INTERNATIONAL SETTLEMENT AGREEMENTS;\n\nAND TO PROVIDE FOR MATTERS CONNECTED THEREWITH OR\n\nINCIDENTAL THERETO.\n\nWHEREAS the Convention on International SettlementAgreements Resulting from Mediation (hereinafter referredto as the \u201cConvention\u201d) was adopted by the United NationsGeneral Assembly on the Twentieth day of December TwoThousand and Eighteen, and subsequently came into forceon the Twelfth day of September Two Thousand and Twenty:"
