    "chunk_text": "AND WHEREAS the said Foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established and has applied tobe incorporated and it will be expedient to grant the saidapplication:\n\nBE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the My Dream JaffnaFoundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2023.\n\n(2) The body corporate shall be deemed to be a VoluntarySocial Service Organization within the meaning, and for thepurpose of the Voluntary Social Services Organizations(Registration and Supervision) Act, No. 31 of 1980 and theprovisions of that Act shall apply to and in relation to themanagement of the affairs of the Corporation.30\n\n2My Dream Jaffna Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\nThe Generalobjects of thebodycorporate\n\n25\n\n3.The body corporate shall operates exclusively as anot-for profit Organization and it is solely for the benifit ofthe society and its members.\n\n4.(1) The general objects for which the body corporateis constituted are hereby declared to be\u2013\n\n(a)to provide all necessary facilities to the public,having given priority to the development ofeducation;\n\n(b)to give a helping hand to the renaissance in thefield of agriculture, fisheries and livestockDevelopment;\n\n(c)to take constructive measures to build up aphysically and mentally healthiest society;\n\n(d)to give a helping hand for development of language,arts, culture, heritage and litrature;\n\n(e)to contribute in building up a technologicallycentralized society;\n\n(f)to implement socio-welfare programmes with theaim of creating a knowledgeable and strong futureyoung generation;\n\n(g)to take all other constructive measures in order todevelop the economy of the people; and\n\n(h)to implement all other necessary activities toachieve the above socio-welfare projects.\n\n(2) In the implementation of the objects specified insubsection (1), the Corporation shall ensure that such"
