    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 213]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by the Minister of Justice, Prison Affairs andConstitutional Reforms on 07th of November, 2023\n\n(Published in the Gazette on October 16, 2023)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 24.00Postage : Rs. 150.00\n\n2-2d\n\n2-\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nWw\n\nws\n\nTHE RECOGNITION AND ENFORCEMENT OFINTERNATIONAL SETTLEMENT AGREEMENTSRESULTING FROM MEDIATION\n\nto give effect to the United Nations Convention on International SettlementAgreements resulting from Mediation known as the Singapore Convention onMediation; to make Provisions for the Recognition and Enforcement ofInternational Settlement Agreements; and to provide formatters connected therewith or incidental thereto\n\n1The Recognition and Enforcement of International SettlementAgreements Resulting from Mediation\n\nL.D.-O 42/2022\n\nAN ACT TO GIVE EFFECT TO THE UNITED NATIONS CONVENTION ON INTERNATIONAL SETTLEMENT AGREEMENTS RESULTING FROM MEDIATION KNOWN AS THE SINGAPORE CONVENTION ON MEDIATION; TO MAKE PROVISIONS FOR THE RECOGNITION AND ENFORCEMENT OF INTERNATIONAL SETTLEMENT AGREEMENTS;\n\nAND TO PROVIDE FOR MATTERS CONNECTED THEREWITH OR\n\nINCIDENTAL THERETO.\n\nWHEREAS the Convention on International Settlement Agreements Resulting from Mediation (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cConvention\u201d) was adopted by the United Nations General Assembly on the Twentieth day of December Two Thousand and Eighteen, and subsequently came into force on the Twelfth day of September Two Thousand and Twenty:"
