    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the S O S Children's Village ofSri Lanka Organization (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2023\n\nShort title\n\nIncorporationof the S O SChildren'sVillage of SriLankaOrganization\n\nPreamble\n\n25\n\n2S O S Children's Village ofSri Lanka Organization (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n(2) The body corporate shall be deemed to be a voluntarysocial service organization within the meaning, and for thepurpose of the Voluntary Social Service Organizations(Registration and Supervision) Act, No. 31 of 1980 and theprovisions of that Act shall apply to and in relation to themanagement of the affairs of the Corporation.\n\n3. The body corporate shall operates exclusively as a not-for- profit Organization and it is soley for the benefit of thesociety and its members.\n\n4. (1) The general objects for which the body corporate isconstituted are hereby declared to be \u2014\n\n(a) to establish S O S Children's Village in the Islandof Sri Lanka;\n\n(b) to provide children living in S O S Children'sVillages the total protection in the form of\u201cfamily like care\u201d model;\n\n(c) to establish community centres, HermannGmeiner Schools and vocational training centresfor mothers and children ;\n\n(d) to establish youth villages and constructinghouses for adolescent children who are underthe protection of S O S Children's Villages ;\n\n(e) to select and train mothers, caregivers and otheremployees for S O S Children's Villages ;\n\n(f) to enlighten people, organizations and thegeneral public on th concepts such as \u201cprotection\n\nBodycorporateoperates as anot-for-profitOrganization\n\nThe Generalobjects of thebodycorporate\n\n25\n\nS O S Children's Village ofSri Lanka Organization (Incorporation)3\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nin the form family like care\u201d and other children'swelfare concepts through print, electronic andsocial media ; and"
