    "md5": "ee66c06737969800fc253bf7b5bd7bab",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1740,
    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Vanni Mann CharityFoundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2023.\n\n3.(1) The general objects for which the Coporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2013\n\n(a)To conduct motivation programmes to encourageschool children;\n\nGeneralobjects of thecorporation\n\n2Vanni Mann Charity Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\nManagementof the affairsof the bodycorporate\n\n25\n\n(b)To participate in social, cultural and economicdevelopment of the country;\n\n(c)To take measures to protect and discipline andcultural values of the people;\n\n(d)to give assistance to develop worship places;\n\n(e)to establish information technology centers for theadvanancement of scienific studies;\n\n(f)to work towards to protect and develop all rights ofwomen and children;\n\n(g)to promote peace,goodwill, understanding andcooperation among all communities and people ofSri Lanka;\n\n(h)to assist needy school children to enable them tocontinue their education; and\n\n(i)to liaise and co-ordinate with other local and foreigninstitutions which have similar objects.\n\n4. (1) Management of the affairs of the Corporation shall,subject to the other provisions of this Act and the rules inforce for the time being of the corporation be administeredby a Committee of Management consisting of Chairman,Secretary, Treasurer and another eleven members elected inaccordance with such rules.\n\n(2) The first Committee of Management shall consist ofthe members of the Committee of Management holding officeon the day immediately preceding the date of commencementof this Act.\n\nVanni Mann Charity Foundation (Incorporation)3\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25"
  },
