    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of December 01, 2023\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 05.12.2023)\n\nDAHAM SEWANE SINGITHTHO LAMASANWARDANA PADANAMA(INCORPORATION)\n\nTo be presented in Parliament by Hon. Gamini Lokuge, M.P.for Colombo District\n\nto incorporate theDaham Sewane Singiththo Lama Sanwardana Padanama\n\nPrice : Rs. 18.00Postage : Rs. 150.00\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nA\n\n(Private Members\u2019 Bill)\n\nDaham Sewane Singiththo Lama SanwardanaPadanama (Incorporation)1\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE DAHAM SEWANE SINGITHTHO LAMASANWARDANA PADANAMA\n\nWHEREAS a foundation called and known as the \u201cDahamSewane Singiththo Lama Sanwardana Padanama\u201d hasheretofore been formed in Sri Lanka for the purpose ofeffectually carrying out its objects and transacting allmatters connected with the said Foundation according tothe rules agree to by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Foundation has hereaftersuccessfully carried out and transacted several objects andmatters for which it was established, and has applied tobe incorporated and it will be expedient for the publicadvantage to grant the said application:\n\nBE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:-\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Daham Sewane SingiththoLama Sanwardana Padanama (Incorporation) Act, No. of2023."
  },
