    "chunk_size_bytes": 1802,
    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:-\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Daham Sewane SingiththoLama Sanwardana Padanama (Incorporation) Act, No. of2023.\n\nShort title\n\nPreamble\n\n25\n\nIncorporationof the DahamSewaneSingiththoLamaSanwardanaPadanama\n\n2Daham Sewane Singiththo Lama SanwardanaPadanama (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\nauthority to have and use a common seal and alter the same asits pleasure.\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be-\n\n(a) educating Pre-school children up to Universitystudents by facilitating many Languageopportunities;\n\n(b) serving Children of all religions together in oneaccord in order to develop Spiritual equal qualitiesamong all students;\n\n(c) identifying, feeding and educating themalnourished and differently abled children indifferent communities; and\n\n(d) to do all such other acts and things as are necessaryfor, and incidental to conducive to the attainmentof the above objects.\n\n4. Subject to the provisions of this Act and any otherwritten law, the Corporation shall have the power to do,perform and execute all such acts and matters as necessaryor desirable for the promotion or furtherance of the objectsof the Corporation or any one of them, including the power-\n\n(a) to raise funds and receive grants, gifts or donations incash or kind;\n\n(b) to acquire, in any manner whatsoever and hold,take or give on leave or hire, sell or otherwisedispose of, any movable or immovable property\n\n25\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation\n\nPowers oftheCorporation\n\nDaham Sewane Singiththo Lama SanwardanaPadanama (Incorporation)3\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nand construct, maintain and alter any building orworks necessary or convenient for business ofthe Corporation;"
