    "chunk_size_bytes": 1860,
    "chunk_text": "(c)to determine the policies related to theregistration system maintained by theBureau;\n\n(d)subject to the provisions of this Act, todetermine the fees or any other charges tobe levied for services rendered by theAuthority; and\n\n9. The Authority shall exercise such powers as may becomenecessary or appropriate in order to achieve its object and forthe effective performance and discharge of the duties andfunctions assigned to it by section 8 of this Act.\n\n10. (1) The administration and management of the affairs ofthe Authority shall be vested in a Board of Directors (in thisAct referred to as the \u201cBoard\u201d), consisting of the followingmembers:-\n\n(a)the Governor of the Central Bank of SriLanka, or a person nominated by him as hisrepresentative, who shall be the Chairpersonof the Board;\n\n(b)the Secretary to the Treasury or a personnominated by him as his representative;\n\nDuties andfunctions ofthe Authority\n\nPowers of theAuthority\n\nBoard ofDirectors ofthe Authority\n\nSecured Transactions8\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n(c)the Chairman and a Director of the Bureauor persons nominated by them as theirrepresentatives; and\n\n(d)the Registrar of the Authority appointedunder section 16 of this Act.\n\n(2) The Board shall, for the purpose of administeringand managing the affairs of the Authority, exercise, performand discharge the powers, duties and functions conferredon, assigned to or imposed on, the Authority by this Act.\n\n(3) The Registrar of the Authority shall be the Secretaryto the Board and shall be responsible for maintaining a recordof the minutes of all meetings of the Board.\n\n11. (1) The Board shall meet at least once in every quarterand the Chairman shall preside at all meetings of the Board.In the absence of the Chairman from any meeting of the Board,the members present shall elect a member from amongthemselves, to preside at such meeting."
