    "chunk_text": "Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows: -\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Sri Lanka National\n\nCommission for UNESCO Act, No. of 2024.\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 46/2008\n\nShort title\n\n2Sri Lanka National Commission\n\nfor UNESCO\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nESTABLISHMENT OF THE SRI LANKA NATIONAL COMMISSION\n\nFOR UNESCO\n\n2. (1) There shall be established a Commission whichshall be called the Sri Lanka National Commission forUNESCO (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cCommission\u201d).\n\n(2) The Commission shall, by the name assigned to it bysubsection (1), be a body corporate with perpetual successionand a common seal and may sue and be sued in such name.\n\n3. The objects of the Commission shall be: -\n\n(a)to assume, alone or in collaboration with otherbodies, the responsibility for \u2013\n\n(i) operation of all UNESCO funded or relatedactivities in Sri Lanka;\n\n(ii)initiation, co-sponsorship and endorsementof all UNESCO resolutions, guidelines,conventions and other instruments at theUNESCO Executive Board and the UNESCOGeneral Conference;\n\n(iii)Sri Lanka\u2019s active participation in subregional, regional and internationalUNESCO activities, ensuring benefit topeople of Sri Lanka without anydiscrimination;\n\n(iv)submitting nominations to UNESCOregistries.\n\nObjects oftheCommission\n\nEstablishmentof the SriLankaNationalCommissionfor UNESCO\n\n3Sri Lanka National Commission\n\nfor UNESCO\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n30\n\n25\n\n(b)to link the relevant ministries, governmentdepartments, semi government, non-governmentand private agencies, institutions, organizationsand intellectuals and the people of Sri Lankaeffectively with the UNESCO programmes andactivities securing the intellectual, scientific,artistic or administrative resources and capacitiesavailable in Sri Lanka;\n\n(c)to develop international cooperation andpartnerships for Sri Lanka as envisaged in Article IIof the UNESCO Constitution \u2013"
