    "chunk_text": "(f)to sponsor and provide subsidies for the affectedpeople at the emergency disaster situations;\n\nBodycorporateoperates as anot-profitOrganization\n\nThe Generalobjects of thebodycorporate\n\n3Mohan Ellawala Social DevelopmentFoundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n(h)to implement programmes targeting to createharmony among all religions;\n\n(i)to contribute environmental management andminimize the environmental destruction byestablishing forestry projects;\n\n(j)to protect ancient places of heritage available inthe area; and to sponsor and contributing toprogrammes aiming at conservation of those forthe future generation;\n\n(k)to intervene directly and indirectly to enhance thestandard of life of different races engaged inplantation industry;\n\n(l)to improve cultivation of farmers and to providelatest knowledge in order to uplift the social welfareand life standard of farmers and sponsoring for thewelfare affairs of their childern;\n\n(m)to intervene directly in guidance connected withinernationals by way of improving the traditionalattitudes of people, indigenous medicine, art,cultural affairs and handicrafts;\n\n(n)to provide legal assistance and legal aid at thecommon and communal issues depending on itsequity;\n\n(o)to provide necessary facilities to the people engagedfor livelihood by way of town and urbandecorations;\n\n(p)to sponsor for national festivals for which it is feltnecessary to be given a contribution;\n\n4Mohan Ellawala Social DevelopmentFoundation (Incorporation)\n\n(q)to develop peoples\u2019 livelihood and counselling inmarketing guidance; and\n\n(r)to implement appropritately the decisions regardingthe current issues with the consent of thefoundation.\n\n(2) In the implementation of the objects specified insubsection (1) the body corporate shall ensure that suchimplementation shall be carried out without anydiscrimination based on race, religion, language, caste, sex,political opinion, place of birth or any of such grounds."
