    "md5": "5123038f8105f232542da35ddc9786a8",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1645,
    "chunk_text": "AND WHEREAS the said Foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was formed and has applied to beincorporated and it will be for the public advantage to grantsuch application:\n\nBE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Siw Wanak AranaFoundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2024.\n\n3. The general objects for which the Coporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be:\u2013\n\n( 1)to conduct motivation programmes to encourageschool children;\n\nGeneralobjects of thecorporation\n\n2Siw Wanak Arana Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\nManagementof the affairsof theCorporation\n\n25\n\n(2)implementation of enviromental protection schemes;\n\n(3)to promote peace,goodwill, understanding andcooperation among all communities and people ofSri Lanka;\n\n(4)to give assistance to develop worship places;\n\n(5)to establish information technology centers for theadvanancement of scienific studies; and\n\n(6)to work towards to protect and develop all rights ofwomen and children.\n\n4. (1) The of the affairs of the Corporation shall, subjectto the other provisions of this Act and the rules in force forthe time being of the corporation be administered by aCommittee of Management consisting of not more thaneleven members including Chairman, Secretary, Treasurerelected in accordance with such rules.\n\n(2) The first Committee of Management shall consist ofthe members of the Committee of Management of thefoundation holding office on the day immediately precedingthe date of commencement of this Act."
  },
