    "md5": "98cff99f4b41fa957495669e60566dee",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1888,
    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Sri Lanka Associationfor Fisheries and Aquatic Resources (Incorporation)Act, No. of 2024.\n\nIncorporationof the SriLankaAssociationfor Fisheriesand AquaticResources\n\nShort title.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\nPreamble\n\n25\n\n2Sri Lanka Association for Fisheries andAquatic Resources (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n3. The body corporate shall operates exclusively as a not-for-profit Organization and it is solely for the benefit of theAssociation and its members.\n\n4. (1) The general objects for which the body corporate isconstituted are hereby declared to be:\u2013\n\n(a) to promote effective interaction and co-operationamong those involved in research and developmentactivities in fisheries and aquatic resources inSri Lanka;\n\n(b) to liaise and co-operate with Government and Non-Government Organizations concerned in suchactivities in Sri Lanka;\n\n(c) to create and propagate an awareness of theimportance and the ways of sound utilization,cultivation, conservation and development ofaquatic resources of Sri Lanka;\n\n(d) to serve as a Forum for Scientists and other personnelto discuss issues and policies to development andconservation of aquatic resources;\n\n(e) to establish liaison with other ScientificOrganizations; and\n\n(f) to facilitate training programmes on fisheries andaquatic resources.\n\n(2) In the implementation of the objects specified insubsection (1) the corporate shall ensure that suchimplementation shall be carried out without anydiscrimination based on race, religion, language, caste, sex,political opinion, place of birth or any of such grounds.\n\nBodycorporateoperates as anot-for-profitOrganization\n\nThe generalobjects of thebodycorporate\n\n3Sri Lanka Association for Fisheries andAquatic Resources (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30"
