    "chunk_size_bytes": 1912,
    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 255]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by the Hon. M. A. Sumanthiran, M.P. for Jaffna Districton 7th of May, 2024\n\n(Published in the Gazette on March 22, 2024)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 12.00Postage : Rs. 150.00\n\n2-2d\n\n2-\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nWw\n\nws\n\nEMPLOYEES\u2019 PROVIDENT FUND(AMENDMENT)\n\nto amend the Employees\u2019 Provident Fund Act, No. 15 of 1958\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2 : This clause amends section 5 of the Employees\u2019 Provident FundAct, No. 15 of 1958 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d), and the legaleffect of the amendment is to ensure adequate and timely publication and disclosure of theinformation required to be published by sub-paragraph (h) of paragraph (1) thereof.\n\nClause 3 : This clause inserts the Schedules corresponding to the amendments tosub-paragraph (h) of paragraph (1) of section 5.\n\n1Employees\u2019 Provident Fund (Amendment)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE EMPLOYEES\u2019 PROVIDENT FUNDACT, NO. 15 OF 1958\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Employees\u2019 ProvidentFund (Amendment) Act, No. of 2024.\n\n2.Section 5 of the Employees\u2019 Provident FundAct, No. 15 of 1958 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d) is hereby amended by the deletion of sub-paragraph (h) of paragraph (1) and replacement thereof withthe following:\u2013\n\n\u201c(h)\n\n(i)shall cause to be prepared in respect of the Fund foreach year a statement of receipts and payments, astatement of income and expenditure, and astatement of assets and liabilities; and"
