    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of May 03, 2024\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 08.05.2024)\n\nPARLIAMENTARY ELECTIONS (AMENDMENT)\n\nTo be presented in Parliament byHon. (Dr.) (Mrs.) Sudarshini Fernandopulle, M.P.\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 150.00\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nA\n\nto amend the Parliamentary Elections Act, No. 1 of 1981\n\n(Private Members\u2019 Bill)\n\n1 Parliamentary Elections (Amendment)\n\nShort title\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE PARLIAMENTARY ELECTIONSACT, NO. 1 OF 1981\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as Parliamentary Elections(Amendment) Act, No. of 2024.\n\n2. Section 7 of the Parliamentary Elections Act,No. 1 of 1981 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d as amended by Act, No. 58 of 2009, is herebyfurther amended by the repeal of subsection 4(d) andsubstitution thereof, with the following:-\n\n\u201c(d)In order to guarantee better representation ofwomen in political parties and in politics,every recognized political party shall ensurethe inclusion of not less than thirty per centumof women office bearers, in a decision makingcapacity, in the list of office bearers of suchparty.\u201d.\n\n3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nAmendmentof Section 7of theParliamentaryElectionsAct,No. 1 of1981\n\nSinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency\n\n2 Parliamentary Elections (Amendment)\n\nDEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING"
