    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of June 07, 2024\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 12.06.2024)\n\nISIWARA DEVELOPMENT, SOCIAL SERVICES ANDCHARITY FOUNDATION (INCORPORATION)\n\nTo be presented in Parliament by Hon. Madhura Withanage(Attorney-at-Law), M.P. for Colombo District\n\nto incorporate the Isiwara Development, Social Services andCharity Foundation\n\nPrice : Rs. 18.00Postage : Rs. 150.00\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nA\n\n(Private Members\u2019 Bill)\n\nIsiwara Development, Social Services and CharityFoundation (Incorporation)1\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE ISIWARA DEVELOPMENT, SOCIALSERVICES AND CHARITY FOUNDATION (INCORPORATION)\n\nWHEREAS a Foundation called and known as the \u201cIsiwaraDevelopment, Social Services and Charity Foundation\u201dheretofore been formed in Sri Lanka for the purpose ofeffectually carrying out its objects and transacting all mattersconnected with the said Foundation according to the rulesagreed by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted several objects andmatters for which it was established, and has applied to beincorporated, and it will be expedient to grant the saidapplication:\n\nBE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Isiwara Development,Social Services and Charity Foundation (Incorporation)Act, No. of 2024."
  },
